attchewyer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199063610207/", "num_games_owned": 17, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3638, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2231, "last_played": 1705636272, "avatar": "b5c548026d579b9751e76d87ede2d7b54a9cb68b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game sucks.  The challenges to unlock the character's abilities and items are more tedious than fun.  Commando is extremely boring and the game forces you to play with him for hours till you learn to git gud, which honestly they should either give you another option of a character to play or revamp his kit (which is why mods are vital to play this booty game).  Once you unlock all the characters and beat the game once, there isn't much for you to do unless you hate yourself and like completing these achievements.  The only upside for this game is the good mod scene which just shows these developers need little modders to actually make their game functional and playable.  Buy if you are masochist then it is good game.  However I am baby and like game that hold my hand so bad game.", "timestamp_created": 1673824838, "timestamp_updated": 1673824838, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.458015263080596924", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130937063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154773875", "personaname": "Cornball", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198154773875/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 5440, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2375, "last_played": 1767137550, "avatar": "4e5cebc9606223f480a60fe64813de21115678f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "RoR2 was executed very well